# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# EthioMatch — Environment Variables Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file and rename it to  .env
#   2. Fill in your actual values
#   3. NEVER commit .env to GitHub — it is in .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Telegram API credentials
# Get these from: https://my.telegram.org
# Steps: Log in → API development tools → Create application
TELEGRAM_API_ID=your_api_id_here
TELEGRAM_API_HASH=your_api_hash_here
TELEGRAM_PHONE=+251XXXXXXXXX      # Your phone number with country code
